flowchart TD
  User[User] --> MOA[MOA: framing, routing, orchestration, completion]
  MOA --> MinisterInitial[Minister: initial conditions]
  MinisterInitial --> Broker[Skill Broker and registries]
  Broker --> Scout[Scout: current evidence]
  Scout --> Forge[Forge: implementation and technical verification]
  Forge --> Verification[Verification gates]
  Verification --> Audit[Independent Audit workflow]
  Audit --> MinisterFinal[Minister: final judgment]
  MinisterFinal --> Completion[MOA: completion governance]
  Completion --> User
  User -. external action authority .-> External[External systems]
  External -. no autonomous access .-> MOA
